{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/jm2Brx.gif?t=1748056763\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <strong>THEANTHRIA</strong>!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a furry dating simulator in progress in which you are the only human in existence! Humans in this world are seen as divine, almost mythical\u00a0 creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your human-tier dexterity and intelligence make you a perfect fit for a DyNein Delivery Pilot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Talk to the girls in town, get to know them, give them presents and have fun with them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn money to buy presents to give, or furniture to decorate your home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The moment you equip your handy, company-provided Jump Pack, you will be open to new deliveries!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/FEkHWs.gif?t=1748056763\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The faster you make those deliveries, the more money you will earn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wall run, double jump, climb, and parkour your way around to make your deliveries as timely as possible to maximize profit!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620140/extras/ScreenRecording2025-03-20193347-Trim-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1748056763\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your cute anthro gf!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets